  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/91493088/0.2.3rc1</id>
    <updated>2024-08-01T06:34:17Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/ValdikSS/GoodbyeDPI/releases/tag/0.2.3rc1"/>
    <title>0.2.3rc1</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Release candidate 1.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bugfixes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Switch to WinDivert 2.2.0-D&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ValdikSS/GoodbyeDPI/commit/67629fb6ef8c2a861bdc279bca8e36ab784050dd&quot;&gt;Disable auto-ttl if set-ttl has been used after auto-ttl&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ValdikSS/GoodbyeDPI/commit/4f18a732390d7e4c72c61ac2df4a26d1f2ee6ad7&quot;&gt;Print correct set-ttl/auto-ttl mode in the status&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ValdikSS/GoodbyeDPI/commit/4c846c712dfedffd1e28405af4240ca6932414a3&quot;&gt;Handle TLSv1.2 record version handshakes (16 03 03).&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2294106538&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ValdikSS/GoodbyeDPI/issues/353&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ValdikSS/GoodbyeDPI/issues/353/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ValdikSS/GoodbyeDPI/issues/353&quot;&gt;#353&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ValdikSS/GoodbyeDPI/commit/60dd3cb004b7a00eb1b4801050e9af56be0b3aa2&quot;&gt;Make ClientHello ignore --max-payload limits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;New features:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ValdikSS/GoodbyeDPI/commit/15eb10ac68cb0031d27ea6b998bdac9df9a229bc&quot;&gt;Fragment packet by the beginning of SNI value.&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2326239276&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ValdikSS/GoodbyeDPI/issues/357&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ValdikSS/GoodbyeDPI/issues/357/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ValdikSS/GoodbyeDPI/issues/357&quot;&gt;#357&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ValdikSS/GoodbyeDPI/commit/d031ae65bfec815d917f89823bcb7b265b5c8450&quot;&gt;New option: -q - block QUIC/HTTP3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ValdikSS/GoodbyeDPI/commit/f1aece75ae05b11c2c8ceec274a39089820c6c7c&quot;&gt;New mode: -7 (As -6 but with wrong chksum)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ValdikSS/GoodbyeDPI/commit/f7362094d3cf2978aa94c0f4d9a99c3c46cf8d3a&quot;&gt;New modes: -8 and -9 (wrong chksum + wrong seq + block quic)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ValdikSS/GoodbyeDPI/commit/9bfce3156eb4a9f840ee41f348cd5cd2f9816d35&quot;&gt;Make mode -9 the default, instead of -5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Packaging:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update .cmd scripts to use &lt;code&gt;-9&lt;/code&gt; mode&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Replace domain in Russian list update script&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Known bugs:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Blacklist option may inconsistently work with Kyber enabled, but should at least work fine without blacklist now. See &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2070245039&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ValdikSS/GoodbyeDPI/issues/330&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ValdikSS/GoodbyeDPI/issues/330/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ValdikSS/GoodbyeDPI/issues/330&quot;&gt;#330&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ValdikSS/GoodbyeDPI/issues/378&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ValdikSS/GoodbyeDPI/issues/378/hovercard&quot;&gt;Обход замедления YouTube в России&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The &lt;code&gt;-2&lt;/code&gt; version have been repackaged. It is the same release as &lt;code&gt;goodbyedpi-0.2.3rc1.zip&lt;/code&gt;, the only difference is in Russian .cmd files (add youtube).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
